<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Handwritten Notes</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: "Kaiti", "STKaiti", "KaiTi_GB2312", "楷体", serif;
    background-color: #e0e0e0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .notebook-page {
    background-color: #fff;
    width: 800px;
    min-height: 1100px;
    padding: 40px 60px 60px 50px;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    position: relative;
    color: #0a1b3f; /* Dark blue ink */
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    border-radius: 5px 0 0 5px;
  }

  /* Notebook holes on the right */
  .holes-container {
    position: absolute;
    right: 15px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-evenly;
    width: 20px;
  }
  .hole {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #e0e0e0;
    box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  /* Header */
  .header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #555;
  }
  .header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .header-label {
    width: 40px;
  }
  .header-line {
    flex-grow: 1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #a0b0d0;
    margin-left: 5px;
  }

  /* Content */
  .bullet-list {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
  }
  .bullet-item {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .bullet-item::before {
    content: "●";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    top: 0.2em;
  }

  .red-text {
    color: #c62828;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .group-title {
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .numbered-list {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
  }
  .numbered-item {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 2em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .numbered-item .number {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50px;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #3b5998;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="notebook-page">
    <!-- Holes -->
    <div class="holes-container">
      <div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div>
      <div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div>
      <div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div>
      <div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div>
      <div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div>
      <div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div>
      <div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div><div class="hole"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="header">
      <div class="header-row">
        <span class="header-label">No.</span>
        <span class="header-line"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="header-row">
        <span class="header-label">Date</span>
        <span class="header-line"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="bullet-list">
      <li class="bullet-item">从神舟一号到神舟十六号，我们“天高地迥，觉宇宙之无穷。”</li>
      <li class="bullet-item">鲜艳的五星红旗在浩瀚的宇宙星空中徐徐飘扬，向世人展示，我们的征途星辰大海。</li>
      <li class="bullet-item">九霄逐梦再问天，阔步强国新征程。</li>
      <li class="bullet-item">将挽天上银河水，散作甘霖润九州。</li>
      <li class="bullet-item">从一张张年轻而沉稳、从容而自信的航天人面孔，窥见的是中国航天的精神密码。</li>
      <li class="bullet-item">探索浩瀚宇宙，是梦想的远航，也是创新的跋涉。</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="red-text">议论文模板示范：</div>

    <div class="group-title">第一组：</div>
    <ul class="numbered-list">
      <li class="numbered-item"><span class="number">1：</span>从“飞天之梦”中读懂坚定理想的赤子之心，永葆“九万里风鹏正举”的笃定精神。</li>
      <li class="numbered-item"><span class="number">2：</span>从“问天之问”中读懂求真求知的探索之心，胸怀“吾将上下而求索”的开拓意识。</li>
      <li class="numbered-item"><span class="number">3：</span>从“太空之吻”中读懂起而行之的进取之心，砥砺“不破楼兰终不还”的实干担当。</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="group-title">第二组：</div>
    <ul class="numbered-list">
      <li class="numbered-item"><span class="number">1：</span>学习“特别能吃苦”的精神，铸就“梅花香自苦寒来”的信念之魂，做艰苦奋斗的“追梦人”。</li>
      <li class="numbered-item"><span class="number">2：</span>学习“特别能战斗”的精神，铸就“千磨万击还坚韧”的斗争之魂，做越挫越勇的“追梦人”。</li>
      <li class="numbered-item"><span class="number">3：</span>学习“特别能攻关”的精神，铸就“吾将上下而求索”的创新之魂，做开拓向前的“追梦人”。</li>
      <li class="numbered-item"><span class="number">4：</span>学习“特别能奉献”的精神，铸就“岂因祸福避趋之”的担当之魂，做无怨无悔的“追梦人”。</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="footer">Campus</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
